msgid "Pick a Windows program"
msgstr "Windows dasturini tanlash"

msgid "Pick a file"
msgstr "Faylni tanlash"

msgid "Pick a folder inside your home folder."
msgstr "Uy papkangiz ichidan papka tanlang."

msgid "Pick a folder of pictures"
msgstr "Rasmlar papkasini tanlash"

msgid "Pick a folder to share"
msgstr "Ulashish uchun papka tanlash"

msgid "Pick a folder, not a file."
msgstr "Fayl emas, papka tanlang."

msgid "Pick a problem to test. Your computer should fix it by itself."
msgstr ""
"Sinash uchun muammoni tanlang. Kompyuteringiz uni oʻzi tuzatishi kerak."

msgid "Pick a test, click Start the test, and type your password."
msgstr "Sinovni tanlang, “Sinovni boshlash”ni bosing va parolingizni kiriting."

msgid "Pick an .exe or .msi to get its Linux version"
msgstr "Linux versiyasini olish uchun .exe yoki .msi faylni tanlash"

msgid "Pick an .rpm or .deb file from Downloads"
msgstr "“Downloads” (Yuklamalar) papkasidan .rpm yoki .deb faylni tanlash"

msgid "Pick an app or game so other computers can reach it"
msgstr "Boshqa kompyuterlar unga ulana olishi uchun ilova yoki oʻyinni tanlash"

msgid "Pick it again in Get a VPN."
msgstr "Uni “VPN olish”da yana tanlang."

msgid "Pick one."
msgstr "Bittasini tanlang."

msgid "Pick the app for the web, mail, calendar, music, videos and photos."
msgstr ""
"Veb, pochta, taqvim, musiqa, videolar va fotosuratlar uchun ilovani tanlash."

msgid ""
"Pick the app. To use it every time for that kind of file, turn on Always use "
