msgstr ""
"Ilovani tanlang. Bunday turdagi fayl uchun uni har safar ishlatish uchun "
"avval “Har doim ushbu fayl turi uchun foydalaning”ni yoqing."

msgid ""
"Pick the box. It's set up again, with its apps. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Qutini tanlang. U oʻz ilovalari bilan qayta sozlanadi. Fayllaringizga "
"tegilmaydi."

msgid "Pick the day. Back keeps it as it is."
msgstr "Kunni tanlang. “Orqaga” uni oʻzgartirmaydi."

msgid ""
"Pick the folder, then how often it changes: every hour, every day or at each "
