"Printers is open. Choose Add Printer.\n"
"\n"
"If your printer isn't there or doesn't print right, open this file again to see how to get the driver."
msgstr ""
"“Printerlar” ochiq. “Printer qoʻshish”ni tanlang.\n"
"\n"
"Agar printeringiz u yerda boʻlmasa yoki toʻgʻri chop etmasa, drayverni qanday olishni koʻrish uchun ushbu faylni yana oching."

