"javobgarligingiz."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Some important system settings were broken, and putting them back didn't fix the start, so your computer went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Baʼzi muhim tizim sozlamalari buzilgan edi va ularni qaytarish ishga tushishni tuzatmadi, shuning uchun kompyuteringiz oldingi versiyaga ({since}) qaytdi, uning oʻz sozlamalari bor. Fayllaringiz va ilovalaringizga tegilmagan, avtomatik yangilanishlar esa toʻxtatilmagan.\n"
"\n"
"Yordamchingizga xabar bering. Wheelhouse-dagi “Muammo tafsilotlarini saqlash” ularni yuborish uchun fayl yaratadi."

msgid ""
"Some video formats (like most web video) need extra codecs that Fedora, and "
"this system, leave out because of patents in some countries. Installing them "
"is your choice and your responsibility.\\n\\nWeb video only: lets Firefox "
"play most web video. A small addition to the system.\\n\\nEverything: plays "
"all common video and audio, in every app. It replaces some parts of the "
"system, so system updates take a little longer.\\n\\nNot now: they're in "
"Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs, any time.\\n\\nPick by what you need. If you "
"only watch video in Firefox, Web video only is enough."
msgstr ""
"Baʼzi video formatlar (masalan, koʻpchilik veb-videolar) qoʻshimcha "
"kodeklarni talab qiladi, Fedora va ushbu tizim ularni baʼzi mamlakatlardagi "
"patentlar tufayli kiritmaydi. Ularni oʻrnatish sizning tanlovingiz va "
"javobgarligingiz.\\n\\nFaqat veb-video: Firefox-ga koʻpchilik veb-videolarni "
"ijro etish imkonini beradi. Tizimga kichik qoʻshimcha.\\n\\nHammasi: barcha "
"keng tarqalgan video va audioni har qanday ilovada ijro etadi. U tizimning "
"baʼzi qismlarini almashtiradi, shuning uchun tizim yangilanishlari biroz "
"uzoqroq davom etadi.\\n\\nHozir emas: ular istalgan vaqtda Wheelhouse > "
"Ilovalar > Media kodeklari boʻlimida.\\n\\nKerakligiga qarab tanlang. Agar "
"videoni faqat Firefox-da koʻrsangiz, “Faqat veb-video” yetarli."

msgid ""
"Some video formats, like most web video, need media codecs that aren't part of the system. The next window explains the choices.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Next. Or Skip: they're in Wheelhouse, Apps, Media codecs, any time."
