"koʻring."

msgid "That folder belongs to someone else."
msgstr "Bu papka boshqa birovga tegishli."

msgid "That folder has no pictures in it (JPEG, PNG or WebP)."
msgstr "Bu papkada rasmlar yoʻq (JPEG, PNG yoki WebP)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "That folder is already shared, as {name}."
msgstr "Bu papka allaqachon {name} nomi bilan ulashilgan."

msgid "That folder isn't shared."
msgstr "Bu papka ulashilmagan."

msgid "That folder wasn't found."
msgstr "Bu papka topilmadi."

msgid "That folder's name can't be shared. Rename it or pick another."
msgstr ""
"Bu papka nomi bilan ulashib boʻlmaydi. Uni qayta nomlang yoki boshqasini "
"tanlang."

msgid "That isn't let in here."
msgstr "Bunga bu yerda ruxsat berilmagan."

msgid "That isn't the disk password, so nothing was changed. Try again."
msgstr ""
"Bu disk paroli emas, shuning uchun hech narsa oʻzgarmadi. Qayta urinib "
"koʻring."

msgid ""
"That was the wrong disk password too many times, so it's locked for an hour. "
"Nothing was changed. Try again after that."
msgstr ""
"Disk paroli juda koʻp marta notoʻgʻri kiritildi, shuning uchun u bir soatga "
"qulflandi. Hech narsa oʻzgarmadi. Shundan keyin qayta urinib koʻring."

msgid ""
"The BIOS screen uses the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or"
" Exit."
msgstr ""
"BIOS ekrani klaviatura bilan boshqariladi. Tugatgach, “Save and Exit” "
"(Saqlash va chiqish) yoki “Exit” (Chiqish) ni tanlang."

msgid ""
"The BIOS's RAID setting (Intel RST) hides the disk. Restart into the BIOS and"
" set the storage mode (often called SATA mode or SATA operation) to AHCI. "
"Windows on this disk won't start after that change, but installing EvenKeelOS"
" erases it anyway."
msgstr ""
"BIOS-ning RAID sozlamasi (Intel RST) diskni yashiradi. BIOS-ga qayta ishga "
"tushiring va xotira rejimini (koʻpincha SATA mode yoki SATA operation deb "
"ataladi) AHCI ga oʻzgartiring. Bu oʻzgarishdan keyin ushbu diskdagi Windows "
"ishga tushmaydi, lekin EvenKeelOS-ni oʻrnatish baribir uni oʻchirib yuboradi."

msgid "The Bluetooth driver is blocked, so there's no Bluetooth."
msgstr "Bluetooth drayveri bloklangan, shuning uchun Bluetooth yoʻq."

msgid ""
"The NVIDIA card runs on the open-source driver built into EvenKeelOS. The "
"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA kartasi EvenKeelOS-ga oʻrnatilgan ochiq kodli drayverda ishlaydi. "
"NVIDIA-ning xususiy drayveri ishlatilmaydi: u EvenKeelOS “shunchaki ishlaydi”"
" degan vaʼdani bajarish uchun juda tez-tez buziladi. Agar u kerak boʻlsa, "
"oʻrniga Bazzite yoki Bluefin-ning NVIDIA nashrlaridan foydalaning."

msgid "The QR code could not be made. Save the log to a stick instead."
msgstr "QR-kodni yaratib boʻlmadi. Buning oʻrniga jurnalni fleshkaga saqlang."

msgid "The USB stick could not be opened."
msgstr "USB fleshkani ochib boʻlmadi."

msgid "The VPN list is missing."
msgstr "VPN roʻyxati topilmadi."

msgid "The Wi-Fi card's driver is blocked, so there's no Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Wi-Fi kartasining drayveri bloklangan, shuning uchun Wi-Fi yoʻq."

msgid "The administrator password was not given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Administrator paroli berilmadi, shuning uchun hech narsa oʻzgartirilmadi."

msgid "The administrator password wasn't given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr ""
"Administrator paroli berilmadi, shuning uchun hech narsa oʻzgartirilmadi."

msgid "The app system (Flatpak)"
msgstr "Ilovalar tizimi (Flatpak)"

msgid "The app's instructions say TCP, UDP or both"
msgstr "Ilova koʻrsatmalarida TCP, UDP yoki ikkalasi deb yozilgan"

msgid "The automatic rollback test worked."
msgstr "Avtomatik qaytarish sinovi ishladi."

msgid ""
"The automatic update is already running, so this window follows it until it's"
" done. You can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Avtomatik yangilanish allaqachon bajarilmoqda, shuning uchun bu oyna u "
"tugaguncha uni kuzatib boradi. Ishingizni davom ettirishingiz mumkin."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%% and the computer isn't plugged in. If the battery runs"
" out during the update, the update is lost and has to start "
"again.\\n\\nRecommended: Not now. Plug the computer in, then start System "
"Update again.\\n\\nOr Update anyway."
msgstr ""
"Batareya %s%% da va kompyuter quvvatga ulanmagan. Agar yangilanish paytida "
"batareya tugasa, yangilanish yoʻqoladi va uni qaytadan boshlash kerak "
"boʻladi.\\n\\nTavsiya etiladi: “Hozir emas”. Kompyuterni quvvatga ulang, "
"soʻng “Tizim yangilanishi”ni yana ishga tushiring.\\n\\nYoki “Baribir "
"yangilash”."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%%. Plug the computer in: if it runs out during the "
"update, the update is lost."
msgstr ""
"Batareya %s%% da. Kompyuterni quvvatga ulang: agar yangilanish paytida "
"batareya tugasa, yangilanish yoʻqoladi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The biggest disk holds {gb} GB."
msgstr "Eng katta disk hajmi {gb} GB."

msgid "The boot entry is already named %s. Nothing to do."
msgstr ""
"Yuklash yozuvi allaqachon %s deb nomlangan. Hech narsa qilish shart emas."

msgid "The boot options can't be read right now"
msgstr "Hozir yuklash opsiyalarini oʻqib boʻlmaydi"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The boot options didn't change: {reason}"
msgstr "Yuklash opsiyalari oʻzgarmadi: {reason}"

msgid "The boot options the computer starts with couldn't be read."
msgstr "Kompyuter ishga tushadigan yuklash opsiyalarini oʻqib boʻlmadi."

msgid "The box is missing or broken."
msgstr "Quti yoʻq yoki buzilgan."

msgid ""
"The buttons at a window's top right minimize, maximize and close it, as on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Oynaning yuqori oʻng burchagidagi tugmalar uni Windows-dagi kabi yigʻadi, "
"kattalashtiradi va yopadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The camera ({device})"
msgstr "Kamera ({device})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The certificate \"{name}\" was added to this computer and has been removed, "
"so it's no longer trusted. If you didn't remove it, tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"“{name}” sertifikati ushbu kompyuterga qoʻshilgan edi va olib tashlandi, "
"shuning uchun u endi ishonchli emas. Agar uni siz olib tashlamagan "
"boʻlsangiz, yordamchingizga xabar bering."

msgid "The certificates couldn't be checked."
msgstr "Sertifikatlarni tekshirib boʻlmadi."

msgid "The change was not made, and nothing was left behind."
msgstr "Oʻzgartirish kiritilmadi va hech narsa qolmadi."

msgid "The check couldn't finish."
msgstr "Tekshiruvni yakunlab boʻlmadi."

msgid "The clock and time zone settings could not be saved."
msgstr "Soat va vaqt zonasi sozlamalarini saqlab boʻlmadi."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed. They start working after a restart, which the setup"
" checklist offers at its end."
msgstr ""
"Kodeklar oʻrnatildi. Ular qayta ishga tushirishdan keyin ishlay boshlaydi, "
"buni sozlash roʻyxati oxirida taklif qiladi."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed.\\n\\nRecommended: Restart now to start using them. "
"Or Later."
msgstr ""
"Kodeklar oʻrnatildi.\\n\\nTavsiya etiladi: ulardan foydalanishni boshlash "
"uchun “Hozir qayta ishga tushirish”. Yoki “Keyinroq”."

msgid "The codecs are removed. Restart to finish."
msgstr "Kodeklar olib tashlandi. Yakunlash uchun qayta ishga tushiring."

msgid "The codecs weren't removed."
msgstr "Kodeklar olib tashlanmadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The computer didn't start properly with the boot options changed in "
"Wheelhouse, so it went back to the version from {since}, with the boot "
"options it had before."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter Wheelhouse-da oʻzgartirilgan yuklash opsiyalari bilan toʻgʻri ishga"
" tushmadi, shuning uchun u avvalgi yuklash opsiyalari bilan oldingi versiyaga"
" ({since}) qaytdi."

msgid ""
"The computer hasn't saved a copy of its settings since this start yet. Wait a"
" few minutes and try again. If it keeps saying this, tell your helper: the "
"copy isn't being saved."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter bu ishga tushishdan beri sozlamalarining nusxasini hali saqlamagan."
" Bir necha daqiqa kuting va qayta urinib koʻring. Agar bu xabar "
"takrorlanaversa, yordamchingizga ayting: nusxa saqlanmayapti."

msgid "The computer locks up"
msgstr "Kompyuter qotib qoladi"

msgid ""
"The computer may not start, or may lose its drive, memory or processors."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter ishga tushmasligi yoki diskini, xotirasini yoki protsessorlarini "
"koʻrmay qolishi mumkin."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts and opens its BIOS settings screen. Save your work first.\n"
"\n"
"The BIOS settings are used with the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or Exit, to start the computer again."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter qayta ishga tushadi va BIOS sozlamalari ekranini ochadi. Avval ishingizni saqlang.\n"
"\n"
"BIOS sozlamalari klaviatura bilan boshqariladi. Tugatgach, kompyuterni qayta ishga tushirish uchun “Save and Exit” (Saqlash va chiqish) yoki “Exit” (Chiqish) ni tanlang."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts, fails on purpose, then goes back by itself. A note at "
"login says the test worked and what the test copy found broken."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter qayta ishga tushadi, ataylab xatoga uchraydi, soʻng oʻzi oldingi "
"versiyaga qaytadi. Kirishdagi eslatmada sinov ishlagani va sinov nusxasida "
"nima buzilgani aytiladi."

msgid "The computer starts with the usual settings."
msgstr "Kompyuter odatdagi sozlamalar bilan ishga tushadi."

msgid ""
"The computer would start without the desktop: a text screen or a rescue "
"shell."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter ish stolisiz ishga tushadi: matnli ekran yoki qutqaruv qobigʻi."

msgid "The desktop"
msgstr "Ish stoli"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Qurilma qoidasi qoʻshilmadi, shuning uchun qurilma ishlamasligi mumkin.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Qurilma qoidasi qoʻshilmadi, shuning uchun qurilma ishlamasligi mumkin.\n"
"{details}"

msgid "The disk is full. Free some space, then try again."
msgstr "Disk toʻlgan. Biroz joy boʻshating, soʻng qayta urinib koʻring."

msgid "The disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Disk BIOS sozlamasi tufayli yashirilgan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The disk {disk} was not found, or can't be written to."
msgstr "{disk} diski topilmadi yoki unga yozib boʻlmaydi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download source stays. Open {filename} again to pick an app, or remove it"
" in Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove apps."
msgstr ""
"Yuklab olish manbai qoladi. Ilova tanlash uchun {filename} ni yana oching "
"yoki uni Wheelhouse > Ilovalar > Ilovalarni oʻchirish boʻlimida olib "
"tashlang."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download source was added, but it has no apps to show right now. Check "
"your internet connection, then open {filename} again."
msgstr ""
"Yuklab olish manbai qoʻshildi, lekin hozir unda koʻrsatiladigan ilovalar "
"yoʻq. Internet ulanishingizni tekshiring, soʻng {filename} ni yana oching."

msgid ""
"The earlier version doesn't have the settings repair yet, so if the repair "
"didn't work, going back to it would give a wrong message. Run the test after "
"the next update."
msgstr ""
"Avvalgi versiyada sozlamalarni tiklash hali yoʻq, shuning uchun tiklash "
"ishlamagan boʻlsa, unga qaytish notoʻgʻri xabar beradi. Sinovni keyingi "
"yangilanishdan keyin boshlang."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The file could not be written: {error}."
msgstr "Faylni yozib boʻlmadi: {error}."

msgid "The fingerprint reader"
msgstr "Barmoq izi oʻquvchisi"

msgid "The firewall"
msgstr "Xavfsizlik devori"

msgid "The firewall didn't reload."
msgstr "Xavfsizlik devori qayta yuklanmadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The firewall didn't take the change: {reason}"
msgstr "Xavfsizlik devori oʻzgartirishni qabul qilmadi: {reason}"

msgid "The firewall doesn't start"
msgstr "Xavfsizlik devori ishga tushmaydi"

msgid ""
"The firewall fails to start, so during the test the computer has no firewall."
msgstr ""
"Xavfsizlik devori ishga tushmaydi, shuning uchun sinov davomida kompyuterda "
"xavfsizlik devori boʻlmaydi."

msgid "The firewall isn't answering"
msgstr "Xavfsizlik devori javob bermayapti"

msgid "The firmware update didn't finish. Try again later."
msgstr "Proshivka yangilanishi tugamadi. Keyinroq qayta urinib koʻring."

msgid "The firmware updater"
msgstr "Proshivka yangilagichi"

msgid ""
"The first meeting asks whether to install Chrome or use your usual browser."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi uchrashuvda Chrome-ni oʻrnatish yoki odatdagi brauzeringizdan "
"foydalanish soʻraladi."

msgid ""
"The first time, choose Install Chrome or Use the usual browser. The meeting "
"opens in Zoom's web version."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi marta “Chrome-ni oʻrnatish” yoki “Odatdagi brauzerdan foydalanish”ni"
" tanlang. Uchrashuv Zoom-ning veb-versiyasida ochiladi."

msgid "The full codecs are already installed. Restart if you have not yet."
msgstr ""
"Toʻliq kodeklar allaqachon oʻrnatilgan. Hali qayta ishga tushirmagan "
"boʻlsangiz, qayta ishga tushiring."

msgid "The full guide"
msgstr "Toʻliq qoʻllanma"

msgid "The full name is empty."
msgstr "Toʻliq ism boʻsh."

msgid ""
"The graphics driver is blocked, so the screen runs in a basic mode: it may "
"look blurry or slow, or stay black (then just wait)."
msgstr ""
"Grafika drayveri bloklangan, shuning uchun ekran oddiy rejimda ishlaydi: u "
"xira yoki sekin koʻrinishi yoki qora boʻlib qolishi mumkin (unda shunchaki "
"kuting)."

msgid "The install could not be finished."
msgstr "Oʻrnatishni yakunlab boʻlmadi."

msgid "The install stopped"
msgstr "Oʻrnatish toʻxtadi"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The installer could not start: {error}"
msgstr "Oʻrnatuvchini ishga tushirib boʻlmadi: {error}"

msgid "The installer couldn't open. Use Install EvenKeelOS in the dock."
msgstr ""
"Oʻrnatuvchini ochib boʻlmadi. Dokdagi “EvenKeelOS-ni oʻrnatish”dan "
"foydalaning."

msgid "The installer stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Oʻrnatuvchi kutilmaganda toʻxtab qoldi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The keyboard ({device})"
msgstr "Klaviatura ({device})"

msgid "The last lines of the log:"
msgstr "Jurnalning oxirgi satrlari:"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgid_plural ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr[0] ""
"Oxirgi ishga tushish tekshiruvlardan oʻtmadi va baʼzi tizim sozlamalari yoʻq yoki almashtirilgan edi. Kompyuteringiz {saved} saqlagan nusxadan {n} ta sozlamani qaytardi, soʻng qayta ishga tushdi. Fayllaringiz va ilovalaringizga tegilmagan.\n"
"\n"
"Qaytarildi: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"Agar bu yana takrorlansa, yordamchingizga xabar bering. Wheelhouse-dagi “Muammo tafsilotlarini saqlash” ularni yuborish uchun fayl yaratadi."
msgstr[1] ""
"Oxirgi ishga tushish tekshiruvlardan oʻtmadi va baʼzi tizim sozlamalari yoʻq yoki almashtirilgan edi. Kompyuteringiz {saved} saqlagan nusxadan {n} ta sozlamani qaytardi, soʻng qayta ishga tushdi. Fayllaringiz va ilovalaringizga tegilmagan.\n"
"\n"
"Qaytarildi: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"Agar bu yana takrorlansa, yordamchingizga xabar bering. Wheelhouse-dagi “Muammo tafsilotlarini saqlash” ularni yuborish uchun fayl yaratadi."

msgid "The layout didn't change."
msgstr "Ish stoli tartibi oʻzgarmadi."

msgid ""
"The layout, colors, wallpaper, dark at night, fonts, screen size, night "
"light, sound and accounts"
msgstr ""
"Ish stoli tartibi, ranglar, fon rasmi, kechasi qorongʻu uslub, shriftlar, "
"ekran oʻlchami, tungi yorugʻlik, ovoz va hisoblar"

msgid "The login screen doesn't start"
msgstr "Kirish ekrani ishga tushmaydi"

msgid ""
"The login screen fails to start, so you never see it. The computer restarts "
"by itself within seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Kirish ekrani ishga tushmaydi, shuning uchun uni umuman koʻrmaysiz. Kompyuter"
" bir necha soniya ichida oʻzi ikki marta qayta ishga tushadi va uchinchi "
"ishga tushish yana shu versiyada boʻladi."

msgid ""
"The login screen works, but logging in drops you back to it. Log in a second "
"time; after the second drop the computer restarts by itself. Do that on 2 "
"starts, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Kirish ekrani ishlaydi, lekin tizimga kirgach, yana unga qaytarib yuboradi. "
"Ikkinchi marta kiring; ikkinchi qaytarishdan keyin kompyuter oʻzi qayta ishga"
" tushadi. Buni 2 marta ishga tushishda qiling, uchinchi ishga tushish esa "
"yana shu versiyada boʻladi."

msgid "The media codecs start working after a restart."
msgstr "Media kodeklari qayta ishga tushirishdan keyin ishlay boshlaydi."

msgid ""
"The menu that opens has Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the sound volume, the screen "
"brightness, the power mode, dark style and night light."
msgstr ""
"Ochiladigan menyuda Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, ovoz balandligi, ekran yorqinligi, "
"quvvat rejimi, qorongʻu uslub va tungi yorugʻlik bor."

msgid "The new files could not be labelled."
msgstr "Yangi fayllarga belgi (label) qoʻyib boʻlmadi."

msgid "The new partitions did not show up."
msgstr "Yangi boʻlimlar koʻrinmadi."

msgid "The new system could not be set to take signed updates."
msgstr ""
"Yangi tizimni imzolangan yangilanishlarni qabul qiladigan qilib sozlab "
"boʻlmadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The new system has no {name} group."
msgstr "Yangi tizimda {name} guruhi yoʻq."

msgid "The new system's desktop layouts could not be found."
msgstr "Yangi tizimning ish stoli tartiblari topilmadi."

msgid "The new system's settings database could not be found."
msgstr "Yangi tizimning sozlamalar maʼlumotlar bazasi topilmadi."

msgid "The next network you join starts as a Public place."
msgstr "Siz ulanadigan keyingi tarmoq Jamoat joyi boʻlib boshlanadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The next start uses: {settings}"
msgstr "Keyingi ishga tushishda ishlatiladi: {settings}"

msgid "The one-time setup window is already closed."
msgstr "Bir martalik sozlash oynasi allaqachon yopilgan."

msgid "The password is typed and matches."
msgstr "Parol kiritilgan va mos keladi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The password wasn't saved: {reason}"
msgstr "Parol saqlanmadi: {reason}"

msgid ""
"The picture is copied, ready to paste, and saved in Pictures, Screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Rasm nusxalandi, qoʻyishga tayyor va “Pictures > Skrinshotlar” papkasiga "
"saqlandi."

msgid ""
"The power button in that menu has Suspend, Restart, Power Off and Log Out."
msgstr ""
"Oʻsha menyudagi quvvat tugmasida “Toʻxtatib turish”, “Qayta ishga tushirish”,"
" “Oʻchirish” va “Chiqish” bor."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The printer driver {title} is ready."
msgstr "{title} printer drayveri tayyor."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The printer driver {title} is ready.\n"
"\n"
"Open Printers: choose Add Printer, then your printer."
msgstr ""
"{title} printer drayveri tayyor.\n"
"\n"
"“Printerlar”ni oching: “Printer qoʻshish”ni, soʻng printeringizni tanlang."

msgid "The printing service fails to start."
msgstr "Chop etish xizmati ishga tushmaydi."

msgid "The restart didn't start"
msgstr "Qayta ishga tushirish boshlanmadi"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The restart said:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Exit code: {code}"
msgstr ""
"Qayta ishga tushirish xabari:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Chiqish kodi: {code}"

msgid ""
"The root account is the system's own administrator. Most people never need "
"it: your own account can be an administrator instead."
msgstr ""
"Root hisobi — tizimning oʻz administratori. Koʻpchilikka u hech qachon kerak "
"boʻlmaydi: buning oʻrniga oʻz hisobingiz administrator boʻlishi mumkin."

msgid "The root password could not be set."
msgstr "Root parolini oʻrnatib boʻlmadi."

msgid "The screen flashes white, often with an outside display"
msgstr "Ekran oq miltillaydi, koʻpincha tashqi displey ulanganda"

msgid ""
"The settings are deleted, but the computer didn't restart. Restart it now: "
"the next start puts them back."
msgstr ""
"Sozlamalar oʻchirildi, lekin kompyuter qayta ishga tushmadi. Uni hozir qayta "
"ishga tushiring: keyingi ishga tushishda ular qaytariladi."

msgid "The settings repair test didn't work."
msgstr "Sozlamalarni tiklash sinovi ishlamadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The settings repair test didn't work: your computer couldn't put the deleted settings back, so it went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Sozlamalarni tiklash sinovi ishlamadi: kompyuteringiz oʻchirilgan sozlamalarni qaytara olmadi, shuning uchun u oldingi versiyaga ({since}) qaytdi, uning oʻz sozlamalari bor. Fayllaringiz va ilovalaringizga tegilmagan, avtomatik yangilanishlar esa toʻxtatilmagan.\n"
"\n"
"Yordamchingizga xabar bering. Wheelhouse-dagi “Muammo tafsilotlarini saqlash” ularni yuborish uchun fayl yaratadi."

msgid "The settings repair test worked."
msgstr "Sozlamalarni tiklash sinovi ishladi."

msgid "The sound chip's driver is blocked, so there's no sound."
msgstr "Ovoz chipi drayveri bloklangan, shuning uchun ovoz yoʻq."

msgid ""
"The start menu, windows, the menu at the end of the bar, notifications, "
"screenshots and shortcuts"
msgstr ""
"Boshlash menyusi, oynalar, panel oxiridagi menyu, bildirishnomalar, "
"skrinshotlar va tezkor tugmalar"

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's dark until it rises."
msgstr ""
"Bugun bu yerda quyosh botmaydi va chiqmaydi, shuning uchun u chiqquncha "
"qorongʻu."

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's light until it sets."
msgstr ""
"Bugun bu yerda quyosh botmaydi va chiqmaydi, shuning uchun u botguncha "
"yorugʻ."

msgid "The system core crashed (a protection fault)"
msgstr "Tizim yadrosi ishdan chiqdi (himoya xatosi)"

msgid "The system core crashed (an oops)"
msgstr "Tizim yadrosi ishdan chiqdi (oops)"

msgid "The system core reported a bug"
msgstr "Tizim yadrosi xato haqida xabar berdi"

msgid ""
"The system itself can't be changed by apps or by mistake. Each update "
"replaces it whole."
msgstr ""
"Tizimning oʻzini ilovalar ham, adashib ham oʻzgartirib boʻlmaydi. Har bir "
"yangilanish uni butunlay almashtiradi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The test copy ({name}) is ready. It starts at your next restart."
msgstr ""
"Sinov nusxasi ({name}) tayyor. U keyingi qayta ishga tushirishda ishga "
"tushadi."

msgid ""
"The test marker is removed. The version without it starts at your next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Sinov belgisi olib tashlandi. Belgisiz versiya keyingi qayta ishga "
"tushirishda ishga tushadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} setting from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgid_plural ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} settings from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgstr[0] ""
"Sinov ishladi. Keyingi ishga tushishda kompyuteringiz muhim sozlamalar yoʻqligini aniqladi, {saved} saqlagan nusxadan {n} ta sozlamani qaytardi va oʻzi qayta ishga tushdi.\n"
"\n"
"Qaytarildi: {what}."
msgstr[1] ""
"Sinov ishladi. Keyingi ishga tushishda kompyuteringiz muhim sozlamalar yoʻqligini aniqladi, {saved} saqlagan nusxadan {n} ta sozlamani qaytardi va oʻzi qayta ishga tushdi.\n"
"\n"
"Qaytarildi: {what}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. Your computer went back by itself to the version from "
"{since}, and the test copy is removed."
msgstr ""
"Sinov ishladi. Kompyuteringiz oʻzi oldingi versiyaga ({since}) qaytdi va "
"sinov nusxasi olib tashlandi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The touchpad ({device})"
msgstr "Sensorli panel ({device})"

msgid "The two don't match yet."
msgstr "Ikkalasi hali mos emas."

msgid "The update did not finish. Details: journalctl -u %s"
msgstr "Yangilanish tugamadi. Tafsilotlar: journalctl -u %s"

msgid "The update didn't finish."
msgstr "Yangilanish tugamadi."

msgid ""
"The update didn't finish. Nothing is broken: your computer keeps running the "
"version it has.\\n\\nTry again later."
msgstr ""
"Yangilanish tugamadi. Hech narsa buzilmagan: kompyuteringiz hozirgi "
"versiyasida ishlashda davom etadi.\\n\\nKeyinroq qayta urinib koʻring."

msgid "The update program"
msgstr "Yangilash dasturi"

msgid ""
"The update program is swapped for one that always fails (until the next "
"restart; nothing on the disk changes)."
msgstr ""
"Yangilash dasturi har doim xato beradigan dasturga almashtiriladi (keyingi "
"qayta ishga tushirishgacha; diskda hech narsa oʻzgarmaydi)."

msgid "The user name is empty."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi nomi boʻsh."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The version you're using now is from {current}. The one from before it, from {older}, is still on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"If something stopped working after the last update: Undo the update. The version from {older} starts at your next restart. Your files and your apps aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Hozir ishlatayotgan versiyangiz: {current}. Undan oldingisi ({older}) hali ham ushbu kompyuterda.\n"
"\n"
"Agar oxirgi yangilanishdan keyin biror narsa ishlamay qolgan boʻlsa: “Yangilanishni bekor qilish”. {older} sanasidagi versiya keyingi qayta ishga tushirishda ishga tushadi. Fayllaringiz va ilovalaringizga tegilmaydi."

msgid ""
"The version you're using now is the one before it with boot options changed in Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Undo the change: the computer starts with the boot options it had before, at your next restart. Automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Cancel."
msgstr ""
"Hozir ishlatayotgan versiyangiz — oldingisining Wheelhouse-da yuklash opsiyalari oʻzgartirilgan nusxasi.\n"
"\n"
"“Oʻzgartirishni bekor qilish”: keyingi qayta ishga tushirishda kompyuter avvalgi yuklash opsiyalari bilan ishga tushadi. Avtomatik yangilanishlar toʻxtatilmaydi.\n"
"\n"
"Yoki “Bekor qilish”."

msgid "The wallpaper changes to the next picture in a folder of yours."
msgstr "Fon rasmi papkangizdagi keyingi rasmga almashadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {fs} file system could not be loaded, so the disk can't be prepared."
msgstr ""
"{fs} fayl tizimini yuklab boʻlmadi, shuning uchun diskni tayyorlab boʻlmaydi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is deleted."
msgstr "{label} oʻchirildi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is not working."
msgstr "{label} ishlamayapti."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is repaired."
msgstr "{label} taʼmirlandi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {label} isn't working.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Repair the box. It rebuilds the box, puts your apps back, then installs {title}. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"{label} ishlamayapti.\n"
"\n"
"Tavsiya etiladi: “Qutini taʼmirlash”. U qutini qayta quradi, ilovalaringizni qaytaradi, soʻng {title} ni oʻrnatadi. Fayllaringizga tegilmaydi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} ({unit})"
msgstr "{name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} graphics drive the screen."
msgstr "Ekranni {name} grafikasi boshqaradi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} service ({unit})"
msgstr "{name} xizmati ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {title} download isn't signed by ArtCraft, so it was not installed."
msgstr ""
"{title} yuklamasi ArtCraft tomonidan imzolanmagan, shuning uchun u "
"oʻrnatilmadi."

msgid "There are no app boxes to repair."
msgstr "Taʼmirlanadigan ilova qutilari yoʻq."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "There is no start-up keyboard layout for {layout}."
msgstr "{layout} uchun ishga tushishdagi klaviatura tartibi yoʻq."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version on this computer to go back to. Only the version "
"you're using now is kept."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu kompyuterda qaytish mumkin boʻlgan oldingi versiya yoʻq. Faqat hozir "
"ishlatayotgan versiyangiz saqlanadi."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version to fall back to if putting the settings back "
"doesn't work, so the test doesn't run. Try it after the next update."
msgstr ""
"Sozlamalarni qaytarish ishlamasa, qaytish uchun oldingi versiya yoʻq, shuning"
" uchun sinov ishga tushmaydi. Uni keyingi yangilanishdan keyin sinab koʻring."

msgid "These security certificates need attention. Pick one to see what to do."
msgstr ""
"Bu xavfsizlik sertifikatlariga eʼtibor kerak. Nima qilishni koʻrish uchun "
"bittasini tanlang."

msgid "They open in Chrome."
msgstr "Ular Chrome-da ochiladi."

msgid "They open in your usual browser. Choose to be asked about Chrome again."
msgstr ""
"Ular odatdagi brauzeringizda ochiladi. Chrome haqida yana soʻralishini "
"tanlang."

msgid "This account can't share folders."
msgstr "Bu hisob papkalarni ulasha olmaydi."

msgid ""
"This computer asks for the disk password every time it starts. The computer's security chip can unlock the disk instead.\n"
"\n"
"This needs the disk password, so it's one for your helper.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Set it up. Or Skip: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Bu kompyuter har safar ishga tushganda disk parolini soʻraydi. Buning oʻrniga diskni kompyuterning xavfsizlik chipi qulfdan chiqarishi mumkin.\n"
"\n"
"Buning uchun disk paroli kerak, shuning uchun bu yordamchingiz uchun ish.\n"
"\n"
"Tavsiya etiladi: “Sozlash”. Yoki “Oʻtkazib yuborish”: u istalgan vaqtda Wheelhouse-da bor."

msgid ""
"This computer can't go back by itself: it was installed before automatic "
"rollback was added, or automatic rollback was switched off. Computers "
"installed from a newer USB have it."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu kompyuter oʻzi oldingi versiyaga qayta olmaydi: u avtomatik qaytarish "
"qoʻshilishidan oldin oʻrnatilgan yoki avtomatik qaytarish oʻchirilgan. "
"Yangiroq USB-dan oʻrnatilgan kompyuterlarda u bor."

msgid ""
"This computer can't open its BIOS settings from here. Press the BIOS key "
"while it starts (often F2, F10, F12 or Delete)."
msgstr ""
"Bu kompyuter BIOS sozlamalarini bu yerdan ocha olmaydi. Ishga tushayotganda "
"BIOS tugmasini bosing (koʻpincha F2, F10, F12 yoki Delete)."

msgid ""
"This computer has no security chip (TPM) that can do this, so the disk "
"password stays."
msgstr ""
"Bu kompyuterda buni bajara oladigan xavfsizlik chipi (TPM) yoʻq, shuning "
"uchun disk paroli qoladi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy ({name}) as its normal version, so a new test can't start from it.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Remove the test marker. The version without it starts at your next restart. Needs your password."
msgstr ""
"Bu kompyuter sinov nusxasini ({name}) odatiy versiya sifatida ishlatmoqda, shuning uchun undan yangi sinov boshlab boʻlmaydi.\n"
"\n"
"Tavsiya etiladi: “Sinov belgisini olib tashlash”. Belgisiz versiya keyingi qayta ishga tushirishda ishga tushadi. Parolingiz kerak."

msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy. Open Test automatic rollback again to "
"remove its marker."
msgstr ""
"Bu kompyuterda sinov nusxasi ishlamoqda. Uning belgisini olib tashlash uchun "
"“Avtomatik qaytarishni sinab koʻrish”ni yana oching."

msgid "This computer started the USB stick in old BIOS (legacy) mode."
msgstr "Bu kompyuter USB fleshkani eski BIOS (legacy) rejimida ishga tushirdi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This desktop uses {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Switch to {new}? It takes effect after you log out and back in.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Bu ish stoli hozir: {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Unga oʻtilsinmi: {new}? Bu tizimdan chiqib, qayta kirganingizdan keyin kuchga kiradi.\n"
"\n"
"Yoki “Uni saqlab qolish”."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file can't be installed. It may be damaged or not fully downloaded. Download it again and retry.\n"
"\n"
"(Details: {details})"
msgstr ""
"Bu faylni oʻrnatib boʻlmaydi. U buzilgan yoki toʻliq yuklab olinmagan boʻlishi mumkin. Uni qayta yuklab oling va yana urinib koʻring.\n"
"\n"
"(Tafsilotlar: {details})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file is an older version of {title} than the one you have.\n"
"\n"
"Install the older version: replaces yours. Only do this if the newer one has a problem."
msgstr ""
"Bu fayl {title} ning sizdagidan eskiroq versiyasi.\n"
"\n"
"“Eskiroq versiyani oʻrnatish”: siznikini almashtiradi. Buni faqat yangisida muammo boʻlsa qiling."

msgid ""
"This is a live session: it runs from the USB stick, nothing here is saved, "
"and the computer's disk isn't touched."
msgstr ""
"Bu jonli seans: u USB fleshkadan ishlaydi, bu yerda hech narsa saqlanmaydi va"
" kompyuter diskiga tegilmaydi."

msgid ""
"This is how the computer shows up on your network. Keep the suggestion, or "
"type a new one."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter tarmogʻingizda shunday koʻrinadi. Taklifni qoldiring yoki yangisini"
" yozing."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is the 32-bit version of {title}, for older computers. Download the "
"64-bit version instead (often called amd64 or x86_64)."
msgstr ""
"Bu {title} ning eski kompyuterlar uchun 32 bitli versiyasi. Oʻrniga 64 bitli "
"versiyani yuklab oling (koʻpincha amd64 yoki x86_64 deb ataladi)."

msgid "This network"
msgstr "Ushbu tarmoq"

msgid ""
"This removes things the computer no longer needs: unused app parts, old "
"system update files, and unused container images. Your files and your apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Bu kompyuterga endi kerak boʻlmagan narsalarni olib tashlaydi: "
"ishlatilmayotgan ilova qismlari, eski tizim yangilanishi fayllari va "
"ishlatilmayotgan konteyner obrazlari. Fayllaringiz va ilovalaringizga "
"tegilmaydi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This saves the computer's recent error messages, its system version and the list of your apps to one file, {name}, in your Documents folder. What your apps showed or opened isn't in it.\n"
"\n"
"Then email that file to your helper. They can see what went wrong without being here.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is sent anywhere by itself."
msgstr ""
"Bu kompyuterning soʻnggi xato xabarlarini, tizim versiyasini va ilovalaringiz roʻyxatini “Documents” (Hujjatlar) papkangizdagi {name} degan bitta faylga saqlaydi. Ilovalaringiz koʻrsatgan yoki ochgan narsalar unda yoʻq.\n"
"\n"
"Soʻng bu faylni yordamchingizga elektron pochta orqali yuboring. U shu yerda boʻlmasdan ham nima notoʻgʻri ketganini koʻra oladi.\n"
"\n"
"Hech narsa oʻzi hech qayerga yuborilmaydi."

msgid ""
"This sets what other devices on this network can reach. Pick Public place "
"anywhere you're not sure. You can change it later in Wheelhouse, Network "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"Bu ushbu tarmoqdagi boshqa qurilmalar nimaga yetib bora olishini belgilaydi. "
"Ishonchingiz komil boʻlmagan har qanday joyda “Jamoat joyi”ni tanlang. Buni "
"keyinroq Wheelhouse > Tarmoq xavfsizligi boʻlimida oʻzgartirishingiz mumkin."

msgid ""
"This sets what you see at first. The next step suggests a desktop layout to "
"match, and the guide is in Wheelhouse, Get help, either way."
msgstr ""
"Bu dastlab nimani koʻrishingizni belgilaydi. Keyingi qadam bunga mos ish "
"stoli tartibini taklif qiladi, qoʻllanma esa har qanday holatda Wheelhouse > "
"Yordam olish boʻlimida."

msgid "This setting is risky"
msgstr "Bu sozlama xavfli"

msgid "This start found these broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr "Bu ishga tushishda sinov kutganidek quyidagilar buzuq ekani aniqlandi:"

msgid "This start found these still broken, as the test expects:"
msgstr ""
"Bu ishga tushishda sinov kutganidek quyidagilar hali ham buzuq ekani "
"aniqlandi:"

msgid "This system's EFI partition: %s (disk %s, partition %s)"
msgstr "Ushbu tizimning EFI boʻlimi: %s (disk %s, boʻlim %s)"

msgid "This takes a while."
msgstr "Bu biroz vaqt oladi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "This version is from {when}."
msgstr "Bu versiya sanasi: {when}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This {title} file is for a different kind of computer. Download the version "
"for this one (often called {names})."
msgstr ""
"Bu {title} fayli boshqa turdagi kompyuter uchun. Shu kompyuter uchun "
"versiyani yuklab oling (koʻpincha {names} deb ataladi)."

msgid ""
"Those are file sharing ports: folders are shared only on Home networks, in "
"Shared folders."
msgstr ""
"Bular fayl ulashish portlari: papkalar faqat Uy tarmoqlarida, “Umumiy "
"papkalar”da ulashiladi."

msgid "Thunderbolt or USB4 ports"
msgstr "Thunderbolt yoki USB4 portlari"

msgid "Time server name"
msgstr "Vaqt serveri nomi"

msgid "Time servers"
msgstr "Vaqt serverlari"

msgid ""
"Time servers to use instead of Fedora's. Type a name and click Add. Click a "
"server to take it off. Click Back when done."
msgstr ""
"Fedora serverlari oʻrniga ishlatiladigan vaqt serverlari. Nomni yozing va "
"“Qoʻshish”ni bosing. Serverni olib tashlash uchun uni bosing. Tugatgach, "
"“Orqaga”ni bosing."

msgid "Time zone"
msgstr "Vaqt zonasi"

msgid "To be asked again: Wheelhouse, Apps, Zoom meetings."
msgstr "Yana soʻralishi uchun: Wheelhouse > Ilovalar > Zoom uchrashuvlari."

msgid "To change your password, click Password."
msgstr "Parolingizni oʻzgartirish uchun “Parol”ni bosing."

msgid "To check that this works on your computer, see Getting help."
msgstr ""
"Bu kompyuteringizda ishlashini tekshirish uchun “Yordam olish” boʻlimiga "
"qarang."

msgid "To choose which apps can notify you: Settings, Notifications."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi ilovalar sizga bildirishnoma yubora olishini tanlash uchun: Sozlamalar "
"> Bildirishnomalar."

msgid "To free the space for good: open Trash and click Empty."
msgstr ""
"Joyni butunlay boʻshatish uchun: “O'chirish”ni (axlat qutisi) oching va "
"“Chiqindini boʻshatish”ni bosing."

msgid ""
"To get it back: open Trash in the left side of Files, right-click the file, "
"and choose Restore From Trash."
msgstr ""
"Uni qaytarish uchun: “Fayllar”ning chap tomonidagi “O'chirish”ni (axlat "
"qutisi) oching, fayl ustida oʻng tugmani bosing va “Axlat qutisidan "
"tiklash”ni tanlang."

msgid ""
"To give someone their own account, click Add User. Leave Administrator off "
"for children and guests."
msgstr ""
"Birovga oʻz hisobini berish uchun “Foydalanuvchi qoʻshish”ni bosing. Bolalar "
"va mehmonlar uchun “Administrator”ni oʻchiq qoldiring."

msgid "To go on, click Erase and install. To pick another disk, click Back."
msgstr ""
"Davom etish uchun “Oʻchirish va oʻrnatish”ni bosing. Boshqa diskni tanlash "
"uchun “Orqaga”ni bosing."

msgid ""
"To make one: select the files, right-click, choose Compress, give it a name, "
"and click Create."
msgstr ""
"Uni yaratish uchun: fayllarni tanlang, oʻng tugmani bosing, “Siqish”ni "
"tanlang, nom bering va “Yaratish”ni bosing."

msgid ""
"To open one: right-click it and choose Extract. The files go in a folder next"
" to it."
msgstr ""
"Uni ochish uchun: ustida oʻng tugmani bosing va “Ekstrakt”ni (ajratib olish) "
"tanlang. Fayllar uning yonidagi papkaga tushadi."

msgid "To print, press Ctrl+P in any app."
msgstr "Chop etish uchun istalgan ilovada Ctrl+P ni bosing."

msgid ""
"To record a video instead, click the video camera icon in the same tool "
"before you start. Recordings go to Videos, Screencasts."
msgstr ""
"Buning oʻrniga video yozish uchun boshlashdan oldin oʻsha vositadagi "
"videokamera belgisini bosing. Yozuvlar “Videos > Ekran tasvirlari” papkasiga "
"tushadi."

msgid "To update now: open Wheelhouse, Updates, System Update."
msgstr ""
"Hozir yangilash uchun: Wheelhouse > Yangilanishlar > Tizim yangilanishi "
"boʻlimini oching."

msgid ""
"Told to add a setting by a helper? Type it under Your own settings. Risky "
"ones are explained first."
msgstr ""
"Yordamchingiz sozlama qoʻshishni aytdimi? Uni “Oʻz sozlamalaringiz” ostiga "
"yozing. Xavflilari avval tushuntiriladi."

msgid "Too weak"
msgstr "Juda zaif"

msgid "Tool"
msgstr "Vosita"

msgid "Top bar, apps from the bottom dock"
msgstr "Yuqori panel, ilovalar pastki dokda"

msgid "Touchpad"
msgstr "Sensorli panel"

msgid "Touchpad found."
msgstr "Sensorli panel topildi."

msgid ""
"Try again in a minute. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get help."
msgstr ""
"Bir daqiqadan keyin qayta urinib koʻring. Agar bu takrorlansa, “Yordam "
"olish”dagi “Muammo tafsilotlarini saqlash”dan foydalaning."

msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "Keyinroq qayta urinib koʻring."

msgid "Try anyway"
msgstr "Baribir urinib koʻrish"

msgid "Try it first"
msgstr "Avval sinab koʻrish"

msgid "Turn automatic updates off or on"
msgstr "Avtomatik yangilanishlarni oʻchirish yoki yoqish"

msgid "Turn it on"
msgstr "Yoqish"

msgid ""
"Turn it on below, and computers on your Home network can open the folders you"
" pick."
msgstr ""
"Uni quyida yoqing, shunda Uy tarmogʻingizdagi kompyuterlar siz tanlagan "
"papkalarni ocha oladi."

msgid "Turn it on from a Home network."
msgstr "Uni Uy tarmogʻida yoqing."

msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "Oʻchirish"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Yoqish"

msgid "Turn on anyway"
msgstr "Baribir yoqish"

msgid ""
"Turn on automatic updates or automatic disk unlock, or free up disk space"
msgstr ""
"Avtomatik yangilanishlarni yoki diskni avtomatik qulfdan chiqarishni yoqish "
"yoki diskda joy boʻshatish"

msgid ""
"Turn sharing off and on again. If this stays, use Save problem details in Get"
" help."
msgstr ""
"Ulashishni oʻchirib, qayta yoqing. Agar bu takrorlansa, “Yordam olish”dagi "
"“Muammo tafsilotlarini saqlash”dan foydalaning."

msgid ""
"Turn the printer on. Plug it in with its cable, or join it to the same Wi-Fi."
msgstr ""
"Printerni yoqing. Uni kabel bilan ulang yoki xuddi shu Wi-Fi tarmogʻiga "
"ulang."

msgid "Turn them on or off"
msgstr "Ularni yoqish yoki oʻchirish"

msgid "Turning automatic updates back on."
msgstr "Avtomatik yangilanishlar qayta yoqilmoqda."

msgid "Turning off automatic disk unlock."
msgstr "Diskni avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish oʻchirilmoqda."

msgid "Turning off automatic updates."
msgstr "Avtomatik yangilanishlar oʻchirilmoqda."

msgid "Turning on automatic disk unlock."
msgstr "Diskni avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish yoqilmoqda."

msgid "Turning on automatic updates."
msgstr "Avtomatik yangilanishlar yoqilmoqda."

msgid "Turns off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "Panel Self Refresh-ni oʻchiradi"

msgid "Turns off Panel Self Refresh and Panel Replay"
msgstr "Panel Self Refresh va Panel Replay-ni oʻchiradi"

msgid "Turns off adaptive backlight"
msgstr "Moslashuvchan orqa yoritishni oʻchiradi"

msgid "Two choices:"
msgstr "Ikki tanlov:"

msgid "Type a setting first."
msgstr "Avval sozlama kiriting."

msgid "Type it again"
msgstr "Yana yozing"

msgid "Type it, then type it again below."
msgstr "Uni yozing, soʻng quyida yana bir marta yozing."

msgid "Type the disk password (the one you type when the computer starts):"
msgstr "Disk parolini kiriting (kompyuter ishga tushganda kiritadiganingizni):"

msgid "Type the disk password twice."
msgstr "Disk parolini ikki marta kiriting."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Type the password for {network}, then click Connect. Back goes to the list."
msgstr ""
"{network} uchun parolni kiriting, soʻng “Ulash”ni bosing. “Orqaga” roʻyxatga "
"qaytaradi."

msgid "Type the password twice."
msgstr "Parolni ikki marta kiriting."

msgid ""
"Type your full name. Your user name is made from it; type over it to change "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Toʻliq ismingizni kiriting. Foydalanuvchi nomingiz undan yasaladi; "
"oʻzgartirish uchun ustidan yozing."

msgid "Type your password, then restart. The fix starts at the restart."
msgstr ""
"Parolingizni kiriting, soʻng qayta ishga tushiring. Tuzatish qayta ishga "
"tushirishda kuchga kiradi."

msgid "USB drives and memory cards"
msgstr "USB disklar va xotira kartalari"

msgid "USB or Bluetooth headphones may still work."
msgstr "USB yoki Bluetooth quloqchinlar baribir ishlashi mumkin."

msgid "USB stick"
msgstr "USB fleshka"

msgid "Ubuntu box"
msgstr "Ubuntu qutisi"

msgid "Undo it. See Updates and safety."
msgstr "Uni bekor qiling. “Yangilanishlar va xavfsizlik”ka qarang."

msgid "Undo the change"
msgstr "Oʻzgartirishni bekor qilish"

msgid "Undo the last update"
msgstr "Oxirgi yangilanishni bekor qilish"

msgid "Undo the last update in Wheelhouse can still take you back later."
msgstr ""
"Wheelhouse-dagi “Oxirgi yangilanishni bekor qilish” keyinroq ham sizni "
"oldingi versiyaga qaytara oladi."

msgid "Undo the update"
msgstr "Yangilanishni bekor qilish"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Nomaʼlum"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unknown desktop layout {layout}."
msgstr "Nomaʼlum ish stoli tartibi: {layout}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unknown experience {experience}."
msgstr "Nomaʼlum boshlanish nuqtasi: {experience}."

msgid "Unknown option: %s. Run  codecs  to see the choices."
msgstr ""
"Nomaʼlum parametr: %s. Tanlovlarni koʻrish uchun  codecs  ni ishga tushiring."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unknown time zone {timezone}."
msgstr "Nomaʼlum vaqt zonasi: {timezone}."

msgid "Unlock disk automatically"
msgstr "Diskni avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish"

msgid ""
"Unlock disk automatically is off. From your next start, the computer asks for"
" the disk password again."
msgstr ""
"“Diskni avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish” oʻchirildi. Keyingi ishga tushishdan "
"boshlab kompyuter yana disk parolini soʻraydi."

msgid ""
"Unlock disk automatically is on. After some firmware updates, the computer "
"asks for the disk password once. Then turn Unlock disk automatically on again"
" in Wheelhouse."
msgstr ""
"“Diskni avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish” yoqilgan. Baʼzi proshivka "
"yangilanishlaridan keyin kompyuter disk parolini bir marta soʻraydi. Shunda "
"Wheelhouse-da “Diskni avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish”ni yana yoqing."

msgid ""
"Unlock disk automatically is on: the disk unlocks by itself when the computer starts.\n"
"\n"
"Turn off: you type the disk password at every start again."
msgstr ""
"“Diskni avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish” yoqilgan: kompyuter ishga tushganda disk oʻzi qulfdan chiqadi.\n"
"\n"
"“Oʻchirish”: har bir ishga tushishda yana disk parolini kiritasiz."

msgid "Unplug the device and plug it back in so it works."
msgstr "Ishlashi uchun qurilmani uzib, qayta ulang."

msgid "Unsigned kernel drivers could load."
msgstr "Imzolanmagan yadro drayverlari yuklanishi mumkin boʻladi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Up to {max} settings, each name once."
msgstr "{max} tagacha sozlama, har bir nom bir martadan."

msgid "Update"
msgstr "Yangilash"

msgid "Update anyway"
msgstr "Baribir yangilash"

msgid "Update firmware"
msgstr "Proshivkani yangilash"

msgid "Update now"
msgstr "Hozir yangilash"

msgid "Update program broken"
msgstr "Yangilash dasturi ishlamayapti"

msgid "Update the system, apps, app boxes and Homebrew now"
msgstr "Tizim, ilovalar, ilova qutilari va Homebrew-ni hozir yangilash"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Update {title} to the newer version in this file?"
msgstr "{title} ushbu fayldagi yangiroq versiyaga yangilansinmi?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Update {title} to the newer version in this file?\n"
"\n"
"Needs your password and a restart."
msgstr ""
"{title} ushbu fayldagi yangiroq versiyaga yangilansinmi?\n"
"\n"
"Parolingiz va qayta ishga tushirish kerak."

msgid "Updated, except: %s"
msgstr "Yangilandi, quyidagilardan tashqari: %s"

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Yangilanishlar"

msgid "Updates and safety"
msgstr "Yangilanishlar va xavfsizlik"

msgid "Updates can't run"
msgstr "Yangilanishlar ishlay olmaydi"

msgid "Updates for the computer's own parts, like the BIOS"
msgstr "Kompyuterning oʻz qismlari, masalan, BIOS uchun yangilanishlar"

msgid "Updates happen on their own"
msgstr "Yangilanishlar oʻzi bajariladi"

msgid ""
"Updates install on their own. If one stops the computer starting properly, it"
" goes back to the version before by itself and tells you."
msgstr ""
"Yangilanishlar oʻzi oʻrnatiladi. Agar biror yangilanish kompyuterning toʻgʻri"
" ishga tushishiga xalal bersa, u oʻzi oldingi versiyaga qaytadi va sizga "
"aytadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Updates: automatic, from {maker}'s own download source. A daily check finds "
"new versions, which start at the next restart."
msgstr ""
"Yangilanishlar: avtomatik, {maker} ning oʻz yuklab olish manbaidan. Har kungi"
" tekshiruv yangi versiyalarni topadi, ular keyingi qayta ishga tushirishda "
"kuchga kiradi."

msgid "Updates: automatic, with System Update."
msgstr "Yangilanishlar: avtomatik, “Tizim yangilanishi” bilan."

msgid "Updates: automatic."
msgstr "Yangilanishlar: avtomatik."

msgid ""
"Updates: none, because it came from a file. To update, install a newer file. "
"(Some apps, like Discord, update themselves.)"
msgstr ""
"Yangilanishlar: yoʻq, chunki u fayldan oʻrnatilgan. Yangilash uchun yangiroq "
"faylni oʻrnating. (Discord kabi baʼzi ilovalar oʻzini oʻzi yangilaydi.)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updates: {how}"
msgstr "Yangilanishlar: {how}"

msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Yangilanmoqda"

msgid ""
"Updating everything: the system, your apps and the app boxes. This can take a"
" while. You can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Hammasi yangilanmoqda: tizim, ilovalaringiz va ilova qutilari. Bu biroz vaqt "
"olishi mumkin. Ishlashda davom etishingiz mumkin."

msgid "Updating firmware. Keep the computer plugged in."
msgstr "Proshivka yangilanmoqda. Kompyuterni quvvatga ulangan holda qoldiring."

msgid "Updating the system, apps and containers. This can take a while."
msgstr ""
"Tizim, ilovalar va konteynerlar yangilanmoqda. Bu biroz vaqt olishi mumkin."

msgid "Updating the system: checking for a new version."
msgstr "Tizim yangilanmoqda: yangi versiya bor-yoʻqligi tekshirilmoqda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating the system: downloaded part {done} of {total}."
msgstr "Tizim yangilanmoqda: {done}/{total} qism yuklab olindi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Updating the system: downloading part {part} of {total}, about {got} of "
"{size} so far."
msgstr ""
"Tizim yangilanmoqda: {part}/{total} qism yuklab olinmoqda, hozircha taxminan "
"{got} / {size}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating the system: downloading the new version, {size} in {n} parts."
msgid_plural ""
"Updating the system: downloading the new version, {size} in {n} parts."
msgstr[0] ""
"Tizim yangilanmoqda: yangi versiya yuklab olinmoqda, {size}, {n} qismda."
msgstr[1] ""
"Tizim yangilanmoqda: yangi versiya yuklab olinmoqda, {size}, {n} qismda."

msgid "Updating the system: it is already up to date."
msgstr "Tizim yangilanmoqda: u allaqachon yangi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating the system: step {step} of {total}, {stage} ({elapsed})."
msgstr "Tizim yangilanmoqda: {step}/{total}-qadam, {stage} ({elapsed})."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating the system: step {step} of {total}, {stage}."
msgstr "Tizim yangilanmoqda: {step}/{total}-qadam, {stage}."

msgid ""
"Updating the system: the new version is installed. It starts at your next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Tizim yangilanmoqda: yangi versiya oʻrnatildi. U keyingi qayta ishga "
"tushirishda ishga tushadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating {title}"
msgstr "{title} yangilanmoqda"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating {title} in the {label}."
msgstr "{label} dagi {title} yangilanmoqda."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating {title} on the system"
msgstr "{title} tizimda yangilanmoqda"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating {title} on the system. A progress window shows it."
msgstr "{title} tizimda yangilanmoqda. Jarayon alohida oynada koʻrinadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating {title} on the system. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"{title} tizimda yangilanmoqda. Bu bir necha daqiqa davom etishi mumkin."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Updating {title}: {description}"
msgstr "{title} yangilanmoqda: {description}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use 1 to {max} ports from 1 to 65535, each as 8096/tcp or 2456-2458/udp."
msgstr ""
"1 dan 65535 gacha boʻlgan 1 tadan {max} tagacha port kiriting, har birini "
"8096/tcp yoki 2456-2458/udp koʻrinishida."

msgid "Use Flathub"
msgstr "Flathub-dan foydalanish"

msgid "Use Open a port with its number."
msgstr "Raqami bilan “Portni ochish”dan foydalaning."

msgid "Use a network cable, or a USB Wi-Fi adapter that works with Linux."
msgstr ""
"Tarmoq kabelidan yoki Linux bilan ishlaydigan USB Wi-Fi adapteridan "
"foydalaning."

msgid "Use a network cable."
msgstr "Tarmoq kabelidan foydalaning."

msgid "Use letters, digits and -, not at the start or end."
msgstr ""
"Harflar, raqamlar va - dan foydalaning, - boshida yoki oxirida boʻlmasin."

msgid "Use the file"
msgstr "Fayldan foydalanish"

msgid "Use the newer version"
msgstr "Yangiroq versiyadan foydalanish"

msgid "Use the number the app's own instructions give."
msgstr "Ilovaning oʻz koʻrsatmalarida berilgan raqamdan foydalaning."

msgid "Use the usual browser"
msgstr "Odatdagi brauzerdan foydalanish"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Use {min} to 127 characters, on one line."
msgstr "Bitta qatorda {min} dan 127 tagacha belgi ishlating."

msgid "User name"
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi nomi"

msgid "VPN"
msgstr "VPN"

msgid ""
"VPNs, codecs and apps added to the system, while automatic updates are on. "
"New versions start at the next restart."
msgstr ""
"Avtomatik yangilanishlar yoqilgan boʻlsa, tizimga qoʻshilgan VPN-lar, "
"kodeklar va ilovalar. Yangi versiyalar keyingi qayta ishga tushirishda kuchga"
" kiradi."

msgid ""
"Video and audio that need them stop playing. Needs your password and a "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Ularni talab qiladigan video va audio ijro etilmay qoladi. Parolingiz va "
"qayta ishga tushirish kerak."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Waiting for the other install or removal to finish ({doing})."
msgstr "Boshqa oʻrnatish yoki oʻchirish tugashi kutilmoqda ({doing})."

msgid "Wallpaper slideshow"
msgstr "Fon rasmlari slayd-shousi"

msgid "Weak"
msgstr "Zaif"

msgid "Web video is already installed. Restart if you have not yet."
msgstr ""
"Veb-video allaqachon oʻrnatilgan. Hali qayta ishga tushirmagan boʻlsangiz, "
"qayta ishga tushiring."

msgid "Web video only"
msgstr "Faqat veb-video"

msgid "Welcome to EvenKeelOS"
msgstr "EvenKeelOS-ga xush kelibsiz"

msgid ""
"Welcome. A few things to set up, one at a time.\n"
"\n"
"1. Media codecs, for web video\n"
"2. Skip the disk password at startup\n"
"3. How to get apps\n"
"\n"
"Each can be skipped.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Start. Or Later: this opens again at the next login. Or Don't show again: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Xush kelibsiz. Bir nechta narsani sozlash kerak, bittadan.\n"
"\n"
"1. Veb-video uchun media kodeklari\n"
"2. Ishga tushishda disk parolini kiritmaslik\n"
"3. Ilovalarni qanday olish\n"
"\n"
"Har birini oʻtkazib yuborish mumkin.\n"
"\n"
"Tavsiya etiladi: “Boshlash”. Yoki “Keyinroq”: bu keyingi kirishda yana ochiladi. Yoki “Boshqa koʻrsatilmasin”: u istalgan vaqtda Wheelhouse-da bor."

msgid "What happens"
msgstr "Nima boʻladi"

msgid "What is new:"
msgstr "Nimalar yangi:"

msgid "What it does"
msgstr "U nima qiladi"

msgid "What stopped working with them:"
msgstr "Ular bilan nima ishlamay qoldi:"

msgid "What the test copy found broken:"
msgstr "Sinov nusxasi nimani buzuq deb topdi:"

msgid "What's different"
msgstr "Nimasi boshqacha"

msgid "Wheelhouse"
msgstr "Wheelhouse"

msgid "When neither of the two above is enough"
msgstr "Yuqoridagi ikkalasi ham yetarli boʻlmaganda"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Where is {name}?"
msgstr "{name} qayerda?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Where is {network}? This sets what other devices on it can reach once "
"EvenKeelOS is installed. Pick Public place anywhere you're not sure."
msgstr ""
"{network} qayerda? Bu EvenKeelOS oʻrnatilgach, undagi boshqa qurilmalar "
"nimaga yetib bora olishini belgilaydi. Ishonchingiz komil boʻlmagan har "
"qanday joyda “Jamoat joyi”ni tanlang."

msgid "Where it's from"
msgstr "Qayerdan olingan"

msgid "Where things are"
msgstr "Narsalar qayerda"

msgid ""
"Which VPN do you want? Each one comes from its company's own download source "
"and keeps updating. To connect, you need an account with that company."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi VPN kerak? Har biri oʻz kompaniyasining yuklab olish manbaidan keladi "
"va doim yangilanib turadi. Ulanish uchun oʻsha kompaniyada hisobingiz "
"boʻlishi kerak."

msgid "Which app do you want to remove?"
msgstr "Qaysi ilovani oʻchirmoqchisiz?"

msgid "Which app do you want? Start typing its name."
msgstr "Qaysi ilova kerak? Nomini yozishni boshlang."

msgid "Which app should start, or stop starting, when you log in?"
msgstr ""
"Tizimga kirganingizda qaysi ilova ishga tushsin yoki endi ishga tushmasin?"

msgid "Which box do you want to repair?"
msgstr "Qaysi qutini taʼmirlamoqchisiz?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Which city in {region} has your time? Back goes to the regions."
msgstr ""
"{region} dagi qaysi shahar vaqti sizniki bilan bir xil? “Orqaga” mintaqalar "
"roʻyxatiga qaytaradi."

msgid ""
"Which disk should EvenKeelOS go on? Everything on it will be erased. The USB "
"stick this runs from is not listed."
msgstr ""
"EvenKeelOS qaysi diskka oʻrnatilsin? Undagi hamma narsa oʻchiriladi. Bu "
"ishlayotgan USB fleshka roʻyxatda yoʻq."

msgid "Which file do you want to install?"
msgstr "Qaysi faylni oʻrnatmoqchisiz?"

msgid ""
"Which keyboard layouts do you use? Click one to add it, or click it again to "
"take it off. The first one is used unless you switch."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi klaviatura tartiblaridan foydalanasiz? Qoʻshish uchun tartibni bosing, "
"olib tashlash uchun uni yana bosing. Almashtirmasangiz, birinchisi "
"ishlatiladi."

msgid "Which language should EvenKeelOS use?"
msgstr "EvenKeelOS qaysi tilda boʻlsin?"

msgid "Which one? Back goes to the list of languages."
msgstr "Qaysi biri? “Orqaga” tillar roʻyxatiga qaytaradi."

msgid "Which tool do you want?"
msgstr "Qaysi vosita kerak?"

msgid "Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Wi-Fi"

msgid "Wi-Fi driver blocked"
msgstr "Wi-Fi drayveri bloklangan"

msgid "Wi-Fi found."
msgstr "Wi-Fi topildi."

msgid "Wi-Fi password"
msgstr "Wi-Fi paroli"

msgid "Wi-Fi, how safe each network is, and Bluetooth"
msgstr "Wi-Fi, har bir tarmoq qanchalik xavfsiz va Bluetooth"

msgid "Wi-Fi, sound, brightness and power"
msgstr "Wi-Fi, ovoz, yorqinlik va quvvat"

msgid "Will this computer work?"
msgstr "Bu kompyuter ishlaydimi?"

msgid "Windows Program"
msgstr "Windows dasturi"

msgid "Windows Program is open"
msgstr "“Windows dasturi” oynasi ochiq"

msgid "Windows key + L locks the screen."
msgstr "Windows tugmasi + L ekranni qulflaydi."

msgid "Windows programs"
msgstr "Windows dasturlari"

msgid ""
"Windows programs (.exe and .msi) don't run here. Open one anyway: Wheelhouse "
"tells you the version for EvenKeelOS, or a replacement when there is one, and"
" installs it."
msgstr ""
"Windows dasturlari (.exe va .msi) bu yerda ishlamaydi. Baribir oching: "
"Wheelhouse sizga EvenKeelOS uchun versiyani yoki, agar boʻlsa, oʻrinbosarni "
"aytadi va uni oʻrnatadi."

msgid "Windows programs (.exe, .msi)"
msgstr "Windows dasturlari (.exe, .msi)"

msgid "Windows-style"
msgstr "Windows uslubi"

msgid "Windows-style bottom bar or the standard top bar"
msgstr "Windows uslubidagi pastki panel yoki standart yuqori panel"

msgid "Wired"
msgstr "Simli"

msgid "Wired network"
msgstr "Simli tarmoq"

msgid "Wired network: connected."
msgstr "Simli tarmoq: ulangan."

msgid "Wired network: not connected."
msgstr "Simli tarmoq: ulanmagan."

msgid ""
"With the Windows-style layout: click the sailboat button at the bottom left, "
"then Wheelhouse."
msgstr ""
"Windows uslubidagi tartibda: pastki chap burchakdagi yelkanli qayiq "
"tugmasini, soʻng Wheelhouse-ni bosing."

msgid ""
"With the Windows-style layout: click the sailboat button at the bottom left, "
"then click the app, or start typing its name and press Enter."
msgstr ""
"Windows uslubidagi tartibda: pastki chap burchakdagi yelkanli qayiq tugmasini"
" bosing, soʻng ilovani bosing yoki nomini yozishni boshlab, Enter tugmasini "
"bosing."

msgid ""
"With the standard layout: click the logo at the top left, then Wheelhouse."
msgstr ""
"Standart tartibda: yuqori chapdagi logotipni, soʻng Wheelhouse-ni bosing."

msgid ""
"With the standard layout: press the Windows key, start typing the app's name,"
" and press Enter. Or press Windows key + A to see every app."
msgstr ""
"Standart tartibda: Windows tugmasini bosing, ilova nomini yozishni boshlang "
"va Enter tugmasini bosing. Yoki barcha ilovalarni koʻrish uchun Windows "
"tugmasi + A ni bosing."

msgid ""
"Word, Excel and PowerPoint: LibreOffice Writer, Calc and Impress. They open "
"and save Office files."
msgstr ""
"Word, Excel va PowerPoint: LibreOffice Writer, Calc va Impress. Ular Office "
"fayllarini ochadi va saqlaydi."

msgid "Work"
msgstr "Ish"

msgid ""
"Work: like a Public place, nothing gets in and your folders aren't shared. "
"The office's own shared drives still open."
msgstr ""
"Ish: Jamoat joyi kabi, hech narsa kirib kelmaydi va papkalaringiz "
"ulashilmaydi. Ofisning oʻz umumiy disklari baribir ochiladi."

msgid "Working…"
msgstr "Bajarilmoqda…"

msgid "Year"
msgstr "Yil"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ha"

msgid ""
"You can still switch it yourself. It stays that way until the next change."
msgstr ""
"Uni baribir oʻzingiz almashtirishingiz mumkin. U keyingi almashishgacha "
"shunday qoladi."

msgid ""
"You don't need to do anything. If a new version fails to start twice in a "
"row, the computer goes back to the version before by itself."
msgstr ""
"Hech narsa qilishingiz shart emas. Agar yangi versiya ketma-ket ikki marta "
"ishga tushmasa, kompyuter oʻzi oldingi versiyaga qaytadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You're using an earlier version, from {current}, after an undo. The newer one, from {newer}, is still on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"If the problem is fixed or you want it back: Use the newer version. It starts at your next restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or Cancel: the newer version comes back with the next update after the pause."
msgstr ""
"Bekor qilishdan keyin eskiroq versiyadan ({current}) foydalanyapsiz. Yangiroq versiya ({newer}) hali ham shu kompyuterda.\n"
"\n"
"Agar muammo tuzatilgan boʻlsa yoki uni qaytarmoqchi boʻlsangiz: “Yangiroq versiyadan foydalanish”. U keyingi qayta ishga tushirishda ishga tushadi.\n"
"\n"
"Yoki “Bekor qilish”: yangiroq versiya pauzadan keyingi navbatdagi yangilanish bilan qaytadi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You're using the version from {current}, picked when the computer started. At your next restart the newer version, from {newer}, starts again.\n"
"\n"
"To stay on this one, pick it again when the computer starts, and tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Kompyuter ishga tushganda tanlangan versiyadan ({current}) foydalanyapsiz. Keyingi qayta ishga tushirishda yangiroq versiya ({newer}) yana ishga tushadi.\n"
"\n"
"Shu versiyada qolish uchun kompyuter ishga tushganda uni yana tanlang va yordamchingizga xabar bering."

msgid "Your Boot options settings"
msgstr "Yuklash opsiyalari sozlamalaringiz"

msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Hisobingiz"

msgid "Your account could not be found."
msgstr "Hisobingiz topilmadi."

msgid "Your account could not be made."
msgstr "Hisobingizni yaratib boʻlmadi."

msgid "Your account's home folder could not be found."
msgstr "Hisobingizning uy papkasi topilmadi."

msgid "Your account's home folder could not be set up."
msgstr "Hisobingizning uy papkasini sozlab boʻlmadi."

msgid "Your account's password could not be set."
msgstr "Hisobingiz parolini oʻrnatib boʻlmadi."

msgid ""
"Your app boxes are working. The box that did not update was made outside "
"Install Package File, so Repair cannot fix it."
msgstr ""
"Ilova qutilaringiz ishlayapti. Yangilanmagan quti “Paket faylini "
"oʻrnatish”dan tashqarida yaratilgan, shuning uchun “Taʼmirlash” uni tuzata "
"olmaydi."

msgid "Your computer is in good shape"
msgstr "Kompyuteringiz yaxshi holatda"

msgid "Your computer needs an answer before it restarts."
msgstr "Kompyuteringiz qayta ishga tushishdan oldin javob kutmoqda."

msgid "Your computer put back missing system settings."
msgstr "Kompyuteringiz yoʻqolgan tizim sozlamalarini qaytardi."

msgid ""
"Your computer saves its list of what works 4 minutes after a good start, and "
"it hasn't saved one yet. Wait a few minutes and try again."
