#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"This really deletes these files from this computer: the user accounts and passwords (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), the list of disks (/etc/fstab), the login rules (/etc/pam.d) and the administrator rules (/etc/sudoers). Your own files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Save your work and close your apps first: the computer restarts as soon as they're deleted.\n"
"\n"
"If putting them back doesn't work: when a start hangs or stays broken, hold the power button until the computer turns off, then turn it on. After 2 bad starts, the next start is the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, which has its own copy of these settings."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"Bu quyidagi fayllarni ushbu kompyuterdan haqiqatan oʻchiradi: foydalanuvchi hisoblari va parollar (/etc/passwd, /etc/shadow, /etc/group, /etc/gshadow), disklar roʻyxati (/etc/fstab), kirish qoidalari (/etc/pam.d) va administrator qoidalari (/etc/sudoers). Oʻz fayllaringiz va ilovalaringizga tegilmaydi.\n"
"\n"
"Avval ishingizni saqlang va ilovalaringizni yoping: ular oʻchirilishi bilan kompyuter qayta ishga tushadi.\n"
"\n"
"Agar ularni qaytarish ishlamasa: ishga tushish osilib qolsa yoki buzuqligicha qolsa, quvvat tugmasini kompyuter oʻchguncha bosib turing, soʻng uni yoqing. 2 ta yomon ishga tushishdan keyin navbatdagi ishga tushish “Oxirgi yangilanishni bekor qilish” uchun saqlangan oldingi versiyada boʻladi, unda bu sozlamalarning oʻz nusxasi bor."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"When it comes back, a message says the test worked, and the test copy is removed. Don't turn the computer off during the test unless the steps say to. {save}\n"
"\n"
"The test copy takes the place of the earlier version kept for Undo the last update, so Undo has nothing to go back to until the next update."
msgstr ""
"{name}: {steps}\n"
"\n"
"U qaytgach, sinov ishlagani haqida xabar chiqadi va sinov nusxasi olib tashlanadi. Qadamlarda aytilmagan boʻlsa, sinov paytida kompyuterni oʻchirmang. {save}\n"
"\n"
"Sinov nusxasi “Oxirgi yangilanishni bekor qilish” uchun saqlangan oldingi versiya oʻrnini egallaydi, shuning uchun keyingi yangilanishgacha “Oxirgi yangilanishni bekor qilish” qaytadigan versiya boʻlmaydi."

